SUMMARY:Atlanta Black Restaurant Week 2026
DESCRIPTION:« All Events\n 				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	Sunday Funday at The Works				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n		\n			August 9\n\n	\n\n	  @  \n\n\n11:00 AM\n\n		\n\n\n\n	\n	  -  \n\n2:00 PM\n\n\n\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\nFree 				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n									Eat. Play. Sip.Wrap up your weekend the right way with Sunday Funday at The Works Food Hall! This all-ages celebration brings together great food\, live entertainment\, and fun for the whole family. What to Expect: Delicious Food Vendors serving something for every cravingFamily-Friendly Games & ActivitiesIce-Cold Stella Artois Brews for the adults  Fun Starts Early & Goes All Day Whether you’re out with family\, friends\, or flying solo\, there’s something for everyone at Sunday Funday. Come dance\, eat\, sip\, and play the day away! Good food. Good brews. Great vibes. One unforgettable Sunday. 								\n				\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n\n	Categories:	\n		Atlanta	\n\n				\n				\n					\n		\n				\n			\n						\n				\n					\n				\n				\n	\n			\n		Chattahoochee Food Works			\n	\n	\n	\n\n1235 Chattahoochee Ave NW Suite 130\n	\n		\n		Atlanta\,\n\n	GA\n\n	30318\n\n	United States\n\n\n\n\n	+ Google Map \n\n\n	\n					\n						\n	 \n\n\n	\n	 \n\n\n\n	\n\n		\n	\n				\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n							\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n	\n	Add to calendar	\n		\n	\n\n		\n			\n									\n	Google Calendar\n\n									\n	iCalendar\n\n									\n	Outlook 365\n\n									\n	Outlook Live\n\n							\n		\n\n		\n	\n\n				\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n				Dining in the District	\n\n\n		\n	\n		Los Angeles Black Restaurant Week 2026
